        class="font-semibold text-primary"
      >
        *
      </span>
       es obligatorio
    </p>
    <div
      class="space-y-2"
    >
      <label
        class="font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-sm"
        for="nombre"
      >
        Nombre del material 
        <span
          class="text-primary"
        >
          *
        </span>
      </label>
      <input
        class="bg-background border border-input disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 file:bg-transparent file:border-0 file:font-medium file:text-foreground file:text-sm flex focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-ring h-10 md:text-sm placeholder:text-muted-foreground px-3 py-2 ring-offset-background rounded-md text-base w-full"
        id="nombre"
        placeholder="Ej. Resina viniléster"
        value=""
      />
    </div>
    <div
      class="space-y-2"
    >
      <label
        class="font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-sm"
      >
